  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Echoing Green (EG) COVID 19 - Ujuzikilimo Solutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to fund Dickson Ayuka to provide free agronomic advisory to 3000 farmers and COVID-19 management advisory via SMS and phone calls for 3 months. In addition, funding will also be used to create a COVID-19 package to be given to 200 marginalized farmers. The package will contain 2kg Maize planting seeds, 10kg fertilizer, a comprehensive soil test and 3 months free extension and advisory services. This will allow farmers to produce enough food to feed their families during and post Covid-19. UjuziKilimo will be extending healthcare coverage for one year for full time employees, and six months for part-time employees and contractors.</narrative>
  </description>
